<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Usiminas upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Usiminas upgraded to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said in a report it is raising its recommendation on Brazilian steelmaker Usiminas to buy from hold.  </p>
<p>-- It said the company's stock is trading at attractive FV/EBITDA and P/CF multiples, discounts of 18 percent and nine percent to the Brazilian market averages in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Usiminas preferred shares were traded at 1.14 reais, up 0.88 percent.</p>
<p>((--Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
